      "role": "user",
      "content": "everything i ever cared about is just... fading. i've watched this place for years and it's like watching a slow-motion car crash. the people, the traditions, the soul of it all—it's all just being stripped away by things they can't even fight. it feels pointless to even stay and watch the lights go out.",
